Bioarcanic engineering is the practice of manipulating the inherent structure of a creature to add new (or remove unnecessary) functionality. The practice is controversial in most of the [[Geography/Althane/The Occident|Occident]], with the notable exception of [[Geography/Althane/Salores/index|Salores]] where new edible vegetation and pack animals are manufactured to make the fens more livable.
